<p><span>Feeling the burn and not in a good way? We know how uncomfortable and common Urinary Tract Infection treatments can be, which is why we offer a range of treatment options.</span></p>

<p><span>A urinary tract infection (UTI) or bladder infection occurs in the urinary tract, and can spread to the kidneys. UTIs are common in both men and women and can result in symptoms such as, painful or burning sensation when urinating, increased frequency of urination, and blood tinged, cloudy, or strong-smelling urine.</span></p>
<p><span>UTIs are caused by bacteria that enter the body through the urethra and multiply in the urinary tract. It is estimated that E. coli accounts for between 80-90% of UTIs and is overwhelmingly the most common cause of bladder infections.</span></p>
<p><b>Our Partner Doctors can assist you with the medication you need to treat your UTI.</b></p>
